    "每条观之都有它的\"褪色度\"，当褪色度到达100后，这条观之将在地图上消失。别人为观之贴上的有价值贴纸越多，它的褪色越缓慢。发布最有价值的观之来获得更多贴纸吧!" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding - fade explanation",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every post has a \"fade level.\" When it reaches 100, the post disappears from the map. The more valuable stickers others add, the slower it fades. Share the most valuable posts to earn more stickers!"
